title: Eastern Expedition
new-page: true
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/ChenJiongming.jpg
tags: warlord_affairs
on-arrival: {!
Q.week_actions += 1;
Q.eastexped_timer += 3;
Q.chen_strength = 50;
Q.chen_militancy = 0.2;
Q.chen_experience = 0;
Q.chen_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_winhuizhou = 0;
Q.nra_losehuizhou = 0;
Q.nra_winshanwei = 0;
Q.nra_loseshanwei = 0;
!}

= The Eastern Expedition

We finally have a chance to defeat Chen Jiongming in battle. Now, it's time to march east!

- @firsttrial: March into Huizhou.
- @secondtrial: March into Shanwei.
- @root: We need more time to prepare!
- @easy_discard

@firsttrial
choose-if: firsttrialdone = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Huizhou has fallen into our hands.
go-to: battlehuizhou

@battlehuizhou
on-arrival: {! Q.nra_power = Q.nra_strength * Q.nra_militancy * (1 + Q.nra_experience);
Q.chen_power = Q.chen_strength * Q.chen_militancy * (1 + Q.chen_experience);

Q.nra_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.chen_strength)
    * (Q.chen_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.chen_power)) * 0.1;

Q.chen_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.chen_strength)
    * (Q.nra_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.chen_power)) * 0.1;

Q.nra_strength -= Q.nra_casualties;
Q.chen_strength -= Q.chen_casualties;

if (Q.nra_power > Q.chen_power) {
    Q.nra_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_winhuizhou = 1;
} else {
    Q.chen_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_losehuizhou = 1;
}
!}
go-to: huizhoubattlescreen

@huizhoubattlescreen
go-to: winhuizhou if nra_winhuizhou = 1; losehuizhou if nra_losehuizhou = 1

<div>
  <div id="battle_screen">
    <div style="text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <span style="font-size: 24px;">
        Battle of Huizhou
      </span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 20px 30px;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div>National Revolutionary Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ nra_casualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%; font-size: 20px; ">
        VS
      </div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div>Chen Jiongming's Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ chen_casualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #999; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 14px;">OUTCOME</div>
      [? if nra_winhuizhou = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #66BB6A; margin-top: 5px;">National Revolutionary Army Victory</div> ?]
      [? if nra_losehuizhou = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #d42f2f; margin-top: 5px;">Chen Jiongming Victory</div> ?]
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

@winhuizhou
on-arrival: firsttrialdone = 1;

We have defeated Chen Jiongming in Huizhou and have inflicted large casualties against his army! This is a cause to celebrate.

- @done: Hurrah!

@done
go-to: main

@donelose
go-to: main

@losehuizhou

Chen Jiongming's armies have defeated us! We have been repelled back to our starting position.

- @donelose: Unfortunate.

@secondtrial
choose-if: firsttrialdone = 1
unavailable-subtitle: We must march into Huizhou before reaching Shanwei.
go-to: battleshanwei

@battleshanwei
on-arrival: {! Q.nra_power = Q.nra_strength * Q.nra_militancy * (1 + Q.nra_experience);
Q.chen_power = Q.chen_strength * Q.chen_militancy * (1 + Q.chen_experience);

Q.nra_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.chen_strength)
    * (Q.chen_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.chen_power)) * 0.1;

Q.chen_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.chen_strength)
    * (Q.nra_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.chen_power)) * 0.1;

Q.nra_strength -= Q.nra_casualties;
Q.chen_strength -= Q.chen_casualties;

if (Q.nra_power > Q.chen_power) {
    Q.nra_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_winshanwei = 1;
} else {
    Q.chen_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_loseshanwei = 1;
}
!}
go-to: shanweibattlescreen

@shanweibattlescreen
go-to: winshanwei if nra_winshanwei = 1; loseshanwei if nra_loseshanwei = 1

<div>
  <div id="battle_screen">
    <div style="text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <span style="font-size: 24px;">
        Battle of Shanwei
      </span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 20px 30px;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div>National Revolutionary Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ nra_casualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%; font-size: 20px; ">
        VS
      </div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div>Chen Jiongming's Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ chen_casualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #999; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 14px;">OUTCOME</div>
      [? if nra_winshanwei = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #66BB6A; margin-top: 5px;">National Revolutionary Army Victory</div> ?]
      [? if nra_loseshanwei = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #d42f2f; margin-top: 5px;">Chen Jiongming Victory</div> ?]
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

@winshanwei
on-arrival: secondtrialdone = 1; eastexped_active = 0; eastexped_done = 1;

We have defeated Chen Jiongming in Shanwei and have sent him all the way to Shantou! Afterwards, Chen Jiongming has escaped Guangdong.

The traitor is finally gone and Guangdong is only steps away from being united!

- @done: Hurrah!

@loseshanwei
on-arrival: firsttrialdone = 0;

Chen Jiongming's armies have defeated us! We have been repelled back to our starting position.

- @donelose: Unfortunate.
